    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d713">

                <pb facs="0562" n="554" xml:id="pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/13894: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-01-14T19:00:00-05:00">January 14, 1937—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3. Your 18, January 13, 3 p.m.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d713-f1"/> In case there
                    arises in connection with the situation at Sian an emergency calling for the
                    hiring of a private plane to evacuate Americans and other nationals, we are
                    prepared to stand our share of the cost. This authorization is to be acted upon
                    only if you consider that evacuation is imperative and that resort to the means
                    in question is essential for the effecting of evacuation.</p>
                <p>If private plane is used, please telegraph Department promptly the amount of our
                    share of the cost.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
